### API Call for Patient Registration

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/patient/
content-type: application/json

{
"patient_name": "Anu",
"age": 25,
"gender": "Female",
"phone": "9876543210",
"disease": "Fever"
}

### API Call for Doctor Details

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/doctor/
content-type: application/json

{
"doctor_name": "Dr. Rahul",
"department": "Cardiology",
"experience": 8,
"consultation_fee": 500
}

### API Call for Appointment Booking

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/appointment/
content-type: application/json

{
"patient_name": "Anu",
"doctor_name": "Dr. Rahul",
"appointment_date": "2026-10-27",
"appointment_time": "10:30 AM"
}
